stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Absent
  Absent --> Active: consent + validated deterministic write
  Active --> Superseded: newer case snapshot
  Active --> Expired: retention deadline
  Active --> Deleted: authorized deletion/revocation
  Superseded --> Deleted: cleanup request
  Superseded --> Expired: retention deadline
  Expired --> [*]: content removed; tombstone only
  Deleted --> [*]: content removed; tombstone only
